 "remarks": "Welcome to Glenrock! This spacious 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhome offers a comfortable multi-level layout, generous living spaces, and access to the community pool. The main level features a spacious living room with a fireplace and sliders to the balcony overlooking the pool, creating a wonderful space for relaxing or entertaining. The living area flows into the formal dining room, which easily accommodates a large dining table and offers additional space ideal for a home office or sitting area. The kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, tile flooring, and ample cabinetry. A convenient powder room completes the main level. Upstairs, the primary bedroom features its own private full bath, while the second bedroom also offers an en-suite full bath. Laundry is conveniently located on the bedroom level. The lower level provides direct access to the one-car garage along with a large private storage area. Enjoy warm summer days at the Glenrock community pool and the convenience of nearby shopping, dining, and major commuting routes, including I-95, Route 7, and the Merritt Parkway as well as walking distance to the Merritt 7 train station! The heating and cooling system is approximately four years old. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy townhome living in a convenient location!",
